{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet","id":1140229,"title":"MET Changeling the Dreaming Alpha packet","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-14T10:32:58-07:00","id":1140229,"title":"MET Changeling the Dreaming Alpha packet","content":"<a href=\"https://www.worldofdarkness.com/store/home\" target=\"_blank\">So it looks like the CtD LARP Alpha packet is live on the worldofdarkness.com website. </a><br /> <br /> How to get it: <br /> <br /> 1. Register/login to worldofdarkness.com. <br /> 2. Go to the Store menu. <br /> 3. &quot;Purchase&quot; the CtD Alpha packet (don't worry, it's free). <br /> 4. Click on the menu icon that's on your profile avatar and go to &quot;My Stream&quot;. <br /> 5. Select the &quot;Inventory&quot; tab. <br /> 6. Look for &quot;Changeling the Dreaming Alpha&quot; and download. <br /> <br /> (if this will follow the same process as the VtM5 Alpha packets, this will eventually go up on DriveThruRPG. As for when, no idea)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T11:37:11-07:00","id":1140256,"title":"","content":"Well, I started to reading it. There is one thing, I should mention. Please read C20. It is important that game lines to have consistent content. In past we have suffered different writings. It is not about mechanics but names. It is not important to have &quot;dread&quot;, but if you write &quot;dread&quot; instead of &quot;winter&quot; we will get confuse. <br /> <br /> All I have asking for is &quot;consistency&quot;. I hope it changes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7562-kokorowatari","name":"KokoroWatari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T11:52:51-07:00","id":1140262,"title":"","content":"Huh. So right off the bat, in the Boggans section, the fluff makes reference to Brownie spirits, not just on how Boggans are similar to them...but that Brownies are the older version that Boggans used to be known as. <br /> <br /> C20 made no reference to this, and since I haven't seen older CtD books I'll have to ask: did previous text ever make direct references to Brownies in relation to Boggans at all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T12:26:08-07:00","id":1140275,"title":"","content":"Looking for consistency and comparison between MET and C20 is only going to result in frustration and futility, because you're looking for something that isn't there. MET Changeling and C20 had separate, non-overlapping development that while both having older materials as a reference applied their own interpretation and direction to that material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T08:42:59-07:00","id":1140525,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KokoroWatari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet?p=1140256#post1140256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I started to reading it. There is one thing, I should mention. Please read C20. It is important that game lines to have consistent content. In past we have suffered different writings. It is not about mechanics but names. It is not important to have &quot;dread&quot;, but if you write &quot;dread&quot; instead of &quot;winter&quot; we will get confuse.<br /> <br /> All I have asking for is &quot;consistency&quot;. I hope it changes.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Let's be glad this is an Alpha Playtest.<br /> I'm sure Jason Andrews and Jason Carl are going to be cool with getting this to jive, especially as there's been a focus in recent years to get the World of Darkness to get along.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>__________________________________________________ </b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b><i>Preaching the enlightened gospels of Gaming Anarchy</i></b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/225-growls","name":"Growls","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar225_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T08:48:53-07:00","id":1140528,"title":"","content":"Also. This got grim as all fuck!!<br /> <br /> Endless Winter.<br /> Shadow Court out and about as an actual faction, bend on dominating all remaining Glamour.<br /> <br /> At least... Generation Z is now especially resistant to Banality? That's a kind of cool message to send.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>__________________________________________________ </b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b><i>Preaching the enlightened gospels of Gaming Anarchy</i></b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/225-growls","name":"Growls","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar225_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T18:00:22-07:00","id":1144242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Growls</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet?p=1140525#post1140525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Let's be glad this is an Alpha Playtest.<br /> I'm sure Jason Andrews and Jason Carl are going to be cool with getting this to jive, especially as there's been a focus in recent years to get the World of Darkness to get along.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Likely won't happen. They've explicitly stated multiple times, and evidenced with MET VtM and MET WtA that the 20th Anniversary stuff has no real bearing on the MET versions. Different companies, different design philosophies and goals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T18:05:12-07:00","id":1144243,"title":"","content":"I'll really not liking it. It discards too many setting elements in Changeling that make for a great larp.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T21:07:11-07:00","id":1144624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>zenten</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet?p=1144243#post1144243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll really not liking it. It discards too many setting elements in Changeling that make for a great larp.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm left wondering who, exactly, the audience is for this, or for the new MET Werewolf...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T21:57:55-07:00","id":1144632,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>zenten</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet?p=1144243#post1144243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll really not liking it. It discards too many setting elements in Changeling that make for a great larp.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet?p=1144624#post1144624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm left wondering who, exactly, the audience is for this, or for the new MET Werewolf...</div> </div> </div> </div>Uhm...care to elaborate? On Changeling specifically (reading other books right now so I've only had a cursory glance at MET Changeling)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 09-28-2017, 01:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T22:18:49-07:00","id":1144634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet?p=1144632#post1144632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Uhm...care to elaborate?</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't really say much for the Changeling iteration, but the MET Werewolf plays against essential themes of Werewolf, from its bizarre alterations to the Umbra and shunting of the importance of spirits to, I shit you not, Red Talons having listed preferred professions, many of which would require ID that Talons can't forge and wouldn't care about, since they're all wolf or Garou born and hate humanity.<br /> <br /> And the &quot;bite changes the kin's DNA&quot; thing. Oh fuck the bite changing DNA... and somehow making a Werewolf, even though Revised dispensed with the concept of the &quot;Garou gene&quot;...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T22:25:21-07:00","id":1144635,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet?p=1144634#post1144634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I can't really say much for the Changeling iteration,</div> </div> </div> </div>...guess I should have clarified and specified I meant Changeling specifically, but ok.<br /> <br /> Guess I'll just wait for <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar10243_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"10243\" data-vbnamecard=\"10243\">zenten</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-28T10:15:33-07:00","id":1144825,"title":"","content":"Finally got around to digging into this. While I'm a little quizzical at a couple of the changes they've made overall I'm really liking it. I want to play this game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-19T15:13:46-08:00","id":1187663,"title":"","content":"Finally getting around to looking through this thing myself. Still on Arts and Realms chapter. Did have a bit of headscratch over Realms now being modifiers to a Cantrip instead of dictating the target of the Cantrip.<br /> <br /> Making it 5 Seemings instead of 3...makes perfect sense to me. Makes it a lot granular. And I never understood why the regular Seemings boiled down to &quot;Child-&gt;Young Adult-&gt;Elderly&quot;. Adding the equivalent of &quot;adolescent/teen&quot; and &quot;Adult&quot; makes things click more.<br /> <br /> I do love the distinction of how some kiths are viewed through different cultural creatures depending on where in the world the changeling comes from. And solidifies the idea of &quot;the Dreaming is universal across the world&quot; and covers things without having to make more Gallain that don't already exist within the existing canon.<br /> <br /> Shadow Court...is now a much more easily definable antagonist faction. Which I'll gladly take over the more offputting C20 version.<br /> <br /> Also: nobody wants to clarify anything of how this iteration of Changeling apparently misrepresents the entire Changeling setting?<br /> <br /> Also, tangentially, I took a look into the MET Werewolf book just to check some things and...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet?p=1144634#post1144634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I shit you not, Red Talons having listed preferred professions, many of which would require ID that Talons can't forge and wouldn't care about, since they're all wolf or Garou born and hate humanity.</div> </div> </div> </div>Uhm...no they aren't. Red Talons write-up doesn't list any jobs in their auspices. In fact, not all of them do. And there is nothing saying that Garou HAVE to have a job.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And the &quot;bite changes the kin's DNA&quot; thing. Oh fuck the bite changing DNA... and somehow making a Werewolf, even though Revised dispensed with the concept of the &quot;Garou gene&quot;... </div> </div> </div>...you mean the thing that's considered to be just a theory among the Garou? One of many other theories, none of which have substantial enough evidence to give one or the other credence? Not sure why that's an issue if no one even knows for sure if that's the actual cause or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-19T19:10:54-08:00","id":1187717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet?p=1187663#post1187663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Uhm...no they aren't. Red Talons write-up doesn't list any jobs in their auspices. In fact, not all of them do. And there is nothing saying that Garou HAVE to have a job.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe they realized how terrible that was after the beta or gamma, then.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> ...you mean the thing that's considered to be just a theory among the Garou? One of many other theories, none of which have substantial enough evidence to give one or the other credence? Not sure why that's an issue if no one even knows for sure if that's the actual cause or not. </div> </div> </div>So they finally got around to changing that part, too? I guess that's not a terrible thing to hear. It's still not something that should be given word count, though, because it used to be something that was mentioned out of character and thus has a persistence in considerations for some readers, kind of like how Exalted 3rd edition just doesn't use the term &quot;least god&quot; at all anymore. Specifically calling it out as not something that is the case simply isn't needed, nor is an elaborate &quot;lots of frameworks mentioned&quot; setup, if it is indeed all up in the air. It's not like it's clever writing to retcon something out that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-19T19:50:26-08:00","id":1187728,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet?p=1187717#post1187717\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So they finally got around to changing that part, too? I guess that's not a terrible thing to hear. It's still not something that should be given word count, though, because it used to be something that was mentioned out of character and thus has a persistence in considerations for some readers, kind of like how Exalted 3rd edition just doesn't use the term &quot;least god&quot; at all anymore. Specifically calling it out as not something that is the case simply isn't needed, nor is an elaborate &quot;lots of frameworks mentioned&quot; setup, if it is indeed all up in the air. It's not like it's clever writing to retcon something out that way.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean. As is, it's just a bunch of plot hooks that STs can choose to use/not use. If some LARP STs feel like it's a story worth exploring, they go right ahead with it. If not, then it can be ignored with no fuss.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-20T10:28:59-08:00","id":1187888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1140229-met-changeling-the-dreaming-alpha-packet?p=1187728#post1187728\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean. As is, it's just a bunch of plot hooks that STs can choose to use/not use. If some LARP STs feel like it's a story worth exploring, they go right ahead with it. If not, then it can be ignored with no fuss.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, like the least gods of prior editions of Exalted, the concept of a &quot;Garou gene&quot; is not really a plot hook, but rather a setting-strangling lore misstep.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-23T08:33:42-08:00","id":1188882,"title":"","content":"This discussion inspired me to download the packet and see for myself.<br /> <br /> It's quite interesting, actually. The revised Banality chart is arguably better, because it's laser-focused on the changeling life cycle and has a simpler scale (childlings/foundlings start at 1 and it goes from there, and the journey to Bedlam starts at 0).<br /> <br /> Not sure how I feel about &quot;regional kiths&quot; producing modern oddities like Slendermen, though. That's a bit at odds with how I envision the setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13580-hsienfan","name":"Hsienfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13580_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}